msgctxt "228"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr "Non ordinare nulla"

msgctxt "249"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr "Conto"

msgctxt "259"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Ordina"

msgctxt "265"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr "(Sono a corto di soldi.)  "

msgctxt "286"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altri oggetti.)"

msgctxt "318"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altre tartarughe.)"

msgctxt "353"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr "(Non ho scelto niente.)"

msgctxt "381"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Sono esauriti.)"

msgctxt "401"
msgid "Let's see. That comes to %s."
msgstr "Vediamo un po'. Il totale è %s."

msgctxt "430"
msgid ""
"This stir-fry's made with goya, tofu, and eggs. We call\n"
"it champloo, which means \"something mixed\" in the\n"
"Okinawan language."
msgstr ""
"Questo piatto saltato in padella è fatto con goya, tofu e uova. Lo chiamiamo"
" champloo, che significa \"mescolanza\" nella lingua okinawense."

msgctxt "555"
msgid ""
"Pig's ears with a crunchy texture. These go great with\n"
"awamori, the local spirit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "637"
msgid ""
"Sea grapes are actually a type of seaweed found in\n"
"Okinawan waters. They burst open in your mouth for\n"
"a salty sea flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "759"
msgid ""
"These pig's feet are thoroughly boiled and contain \n"
"lots of collagen, making them quite the delicacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "861"
msgid ""
"This delicious peanut tofu is sure to stimulate your\n"
"appetite."
msgstr ""
"Questo delizioso tofu alle arachidi stimolerà sicuramente il tuo appetito."

msgctxt "924"
msgid ""
"These island scallions were grown in Okinawa and\n"
"are similar to green onions. They go great with sake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1027"
msgid ""
"These glazed cubes of pork belly are called rafute by\n"
"the locals and are considered an Okinawan delicacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1133"
msgid ""
"Gurukun is the definitive fish of Okinawa and tastes \n"
"great fried. Eat it while it's hot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1223"
msgid ""
"Our sashimi platter is filled with tasty fish that are \n"
"representative of Okinawa, such as turban, irabucha,\n"
"and gurukun."
msgstr ""
